1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,527
Every time you click a button online, a complex packet journey begins across distributed networks.

2
00:00:06,979 --> 00:00:18,234
Your request first hits the API Gateway for TLS termination and authentication, then routes directly through internal microservices into database indexes.

3
00:00:18,679 --> 00:00:27,198
In less than fifty milliseconds, state is committed and confirmed, delivering sub-second experiences to millions of users.
